Restore original application activation and independent multimedia timers.

Unmodified dd2h.exe Wine relay observes ShowWindow -> WM_ACTIVATEAPP timer
registration (return site 0x4133d8, ID 16), followed by Init_Application's
registration (0x412a9d, ID 33). The old window shim emitted no activation,
all registrations returned 1, and any cancellation stopped every timer.

Use distinct live IDs and cancel only the requested timer. Deterministic
and observed-device runs advance timers by elapsed sample time, including
menus, instead of a fitted engine-frame phase. This fixes missing timer
polling in observed-device mode; per-presentation device time remains coarse
and does not establish original engine audio/control scheduling parity.

